<title>FRANCE: Cap Gemini helped by sales rise.</title>
<headline>Cap Gemini helped by sales rise.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>Shares in software consultants group Cap Gemini gained 2.53 percent on Friday to trade at 247.10 francs at 1112 GMT with dealers saying the share was supported by a 28.5 percent rise in its nine month sales to 10.46 billion francs.</p>
</text>
